### 白名单源：应回显 Origin，并允许凭证
GET http://localhost:8029/api/cors/overview
Origin: https://admin.example.com

### 没有 Origin：普通请求，不写跨域响应头
GET http://localhost:8029/api/cors/overview

### 不在白名单：403
GET http://localhost:8029/api/cors/overview
Origin: https://evil.example.com

### 预检：管理端 POST
OPTIONS http://localhost:8029/api/cors/messages
Origin: https://admin.example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type

### 方法级追加的商城源
GET http://localhost:8029/api/cors/shop
Origin: https://shop.example.com

### 商城源不能打只有全局配置的接口
GET http://localhost:8029/api/cors/overview
Origin: https://shop.example.com

### 映射之外：200，但没有 Access-Control-Allow-Origin
GET http://localhost:8029/api/plain/ping
Origin: https://admin.example.com

### 映射之外的预检：403 Invalid CORS request
OPTIONS http://localhost:8029/api/plain/ping
Origin: https://admin.example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
